<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
	<PropertyGroup>
		<Version>10.3.0</Version>
		<Description>Jakar.Json for Rebus: message bodies of [JsonModel] types are written and read by Jakar.Json, straight to and from the transport message; other bodies go to the serializer Rebus would otherwise use.</Description>
		<PackageTags>json rebus messaging bus serializer source-generator</PackageTags>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>10.3.0 (breaking): a native Rebus ISerializer (JakarJsonRebusSerializer) that decorates the configured serializer, instead of a System.Text.Json converter; UseJakarJson() no longer takes JsonSerializerOptions (configure the fallback with UseSystemTextJson first). Built against Jakar.Json 10.3.0. 10.2.0: built against Jakar.Json 10.2.0, whose writers take a ref TWriter; 10.1.0 calls the removed IBufferWriter overloads and throws MissingMethodException with Jakar.Json 10.2.0. 10.1.0: initial release.</PackageReleaseNotes>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<Import Project="..\Shared\Integration.props" />

	<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="Rebus" />
	</ItemGroup>
</Project>
